 Jacob's 3D Ladders is a lightweight, vanilla-friendly resource pack that gives Minecraft ladders real depth without changing the classic look of the game.

Instead of replacing ladders with something that feels out of place, the pack keeps their familiar texture and shape while turning them into more detailed 3D models. It is designed to be a small visual upgrade that fits naturally into survival worlds, detailed builds, and vanilla-style resource pack setups.

The pack supports Minecraft 1.9 through the latest supported release , with different model systems used across Minecraft generations so older versions can still enjoy the effect.

 ✨ What makes it different?

- Vanilla-friendly 3D models — keeps the original Minecraft feel.
- Multiple visual variants on supported Minecraft versions.
